    given-names: Gehad
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/gegesay89/emop
url: https://carenova-ai.me/emop/
abstract: >-
  EMOP is an Egyptian profile of the OMOP Common Data Model.
  Core clinical tables keep OMOP 5.4 names and grain. Additional
  tables cover national identifiers, governorates, insurance schemes,
  civil and military care, referrals, bilingual names, and national
  source codes. Example vocabularies in this release are illustrative
  and are not official government code lists.
keywords:
  - OMOP
  - CDM
  - Egypt
  - observational research
  - FHIR
